WEB DEVELOPMENT CORPORATION
OWNERSHIP AND INTELLECTUAL-PROPERTY CORRECTION NOTICE
Version: 2.0
Effective record date: 2026-09-14

CONTROLLING NOTICE

HOUSE.legal, located at the repository root, is the highest-order project policy for corporate identity, AI-assisted authorship, ownership attribution, assignment intent, record integrity, and PDF copyright notices. This file is subordinate to and must be interpreted consistently with HOUSE.legal.

CANONICAL REPLACEMENT

Replace every contextual reference intended to identify the corporation that reads:

“Web Development Corporation A, a Delaware corporation.”

with:

“Web Development Corporation, a Delaware Corporation”

“Web Development Corporation A” is recorded as an unintended misnomer and not a separate legal entity where the surrounding context shows that Web Development Corporation was intended.

The owner supplies the following statement for the record: Web Development Corporation was incorporated in Delaware in 2012; Michael Aaron Loftus is its sole owner and incorporator; and references to “Web Development, Inc.” or “Web Development Incorporated” identify the corporation only to the extent lawfully adopted, registered, authorized, and applicable.

OWNERSHIP ATTRIBUTION

Web Development Corporation is the intended corporate copyright owner of qualifying human-authored expression and other transferable rights already vested in, created for, or validly assigned to it. Where an eligible copyright initially remains with Michael Aaron Loftus, he is identified as the human author and initial claimant, with an express intent to assign eligible transferable rights to Web Development Corporation through any legally required signed instrument.

Neither novelty, an AI prompt, AI assistance, synthesis by a large-language model, a footer, nor this notice makes an abstract idea or purely AI-generated material copyrightable. See HOUSE.legal for the complete claim, limitations, assignment-intent record, execution block, and production policy.

COPYRIGHT NOTICE

Copyright © 2012–2026 Web Development Corporation. All rights reserved.

For newly generated or revised PDFs, the terminal year must be computed at build time using the actual publication or revision year. Static PDFs must be regenerated to change their footer.

INTEGRITY

This .legal file and HOUSE.legal are version-controlled, human-readable records. Neither file is technically or legally immutable merely because of its name or extension. Preserve commit history, cryptographic hashes, signed releases, protected branches, access records, and archival copies to strengthen provenance and tamper evidence.

END OF NOTICE
